  "body": "## What's Changed\r\n* Update TFK dependency to v2.21.0 by @sl1pm4t in https://github.com/sl1pm4t/k2tf/pull/111\r\n* Add GHA build workflow and update go version by @sl1pm4t in https://github.com/sl1pm4t/k2tf/pull/117\r\n* Dummy change to test GHA by @sl1pm4t in https://github.com/sl1pm4t/k2tf/pull/118\r\n* Replace hcl2 with hcl/v2 by @sl1pm4t in https://github.com/sl1pm4t/k2tf/pull/119\r\n* chore: remove refs to deprecated io/ioutil by @testwill in https://github.com/sl1pm4t/k2tf/pull/113\r\n* Update versions (go, terraform sdk). Fix projected volumes, add resource kubernetes_cronjob_v1 (batch/v1) by @hashmap-kz in https://github.com/sl1pm4t/k2tf/pull/115\r\n* Release workflow by @sl1pm4t in https://github.com/sl1pm4t/k2tf/pull/120\r\n\r\n## New Contributors\r\n* @testwill made their first contribution in https://github.com/sl1pm4t/k2tf/pull/113\r\n* @hashmap-kz made their first contribution in https://github.com/sl1pm4t/k2tf/pull/115\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/sl1pm4t/k2tf/compare/v0.7.0...v0.8.0",
